 "name": "Curse Weapon: Claw (2 PP)",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "icons/svg/upgrade.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with a claw attack, you can force the creature to take a Constitution saving throw (DC 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength or Dexterity modifier). On a failed save, the target bleeds and takes 1d4 slashing damage at the start of their next turn. This increases to 1d6 slashing damage at 10th level. You can spend 1 CE to make the extra damage necrotic. You must have the <em>Cursed Weapon</em> attribute and choose claw to take this attribute.</p>",
